{
  "uid": "nal-fault-comparison",
  "title": "net-assurance-lab - Fault Injection Comparison",
  "description": "Baseline vs fault-sustained comparison for the latest net-assurance-lab run: loss, RTT percentiles, throughput and proxy drop attribution.",
  "tags": [
    "net-assurance-lab",
    "fault-injection"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Baseline vs fault - same traffic shape, one injected link\n\n`baseline_sustained` (healthy path) is the control; `fault_sustained` runs the same paced stream through the fault proxy: **20% random loss each way, +40 ms delay with up to 30 ms jitter each way, link flap 0.6 s down in every 2.5 s**. Every gap between the two series is the measured effect of that injection in the exported run (`results/latest`). Configured values are shown in the bottom panel and exported as `nal_fault_injection_config`."
      },
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Loss ratio - baseline vs fault",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "nal_loss_ratio{scenario=~\"baseline_sustained|fault_sustained\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Link flap detected (1 = yes)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "nal_link_flap_detected",
          "legendFormat": "flap",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Derived from dropped_flap > 0 in the proxy decision log summary.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
